<newsitem itemid="121797" id="root" date="1996-10-16" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: DFS Furniture profit rises 18.6 pct in year.</title>
<headline>DFS Furniture profit rises 18.6 pct in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 27</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		19.66		  vs 16.57</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.9		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 10.0		   vs up 20.5 pct</p>
<p> Pretax		     31.1		   vs 26.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   184.8		  vs 145.1</p>
<p> Operating result	 29.35		  vs 24.55</p>
<p> Interest receivable    1.76		   vs 1.68</p>
<p> Tax			  10.62		  vs 8.96</p>
<p> Net taxed		  20.48		  vs 17.26</p>
<p> Pay date		   December 13</p>
<p> Div registration date  November 12</p>
<p> Ex-div date		November 4</p>
<p>NOTE - Retailer DFS Furniture Co Plc will offer a special dividend of 10 pence a share as a second interim dividend as it did in 1995. This will cost 10.4 million stg, leaving it with 16 million cash, plus a Customs and Excise payment of 13.1 million.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
